# Repos built in addition to everything in SAUR_ORG. One per line:
#   owner/repo                  GitHub repo, every branch (default -> stable, others -> experimental)
#   owner/repo@branch           only this branch, treated as the repo's main source (stable)
#   https://host/x.git          any git URL (optionally @branch)
#   owner/repo@dev experimental force a channel: stable | experimental (a PKGBUILD's _saur_channel wins)
# Or: saur extra add [--ex|--stable] owner/repo
